  m_Name: Blade10
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Blade10
  description: The Blade10 is a tiny, thin-flat blade positioned at the middle-center-center
    of the jet engine, fabricated from Blades2 material, functioning to further compress
    and accelerate the air flowing through the engine, with an interesting detail
    being its optimized shape for minimizing energy losses due to friction. Its small
    size and thin-flat shape enable it to operate efficiently at high speeds, making
    it a vital part of the engine's compressor stage. By working in conjunction with
    other blades, Blade10 helps to achieve the high compression ratios required for
    efficient engine operation.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
